# Saheb Paper ERP – Overview

## What the App Does
Saheb Paper ERP is a comprehensive digital solution designed to streamline and automate every aspect of paper manufacturing operations. From raw material procurement to final dispatch, the app provides real-time visibility, data accuracy, and operational efficiency across the entire production lifecycle.

## Core Workflows
- **Raw Material Management** – Track inbound shipments, manage inventory levels, and automate stock deductions during production.
- **Production Planning & Execution** – Create pulp formulas, schedule machine runs, and monitor roll production (weight, GSM, dimensions).
- **Quality Control** – Record test results (GSM, brightness, softness), assign grades (A/B/Fail), and automatically update inventory status.
- **Dispatch & Logistics** – Generate packing slips, challans, assign vehicles and drivers, and track order fulfillment status.
- **Utilities Monitoring** – Log boiler, ETP, and electricity usage for cost control and compliance.
- **Full Traceability** – Assign QR codes to every reel. Scan to view complete production history, QC results, and dispatch status.

## How It Works
1. **Modular Architecture** – Separate modules for each business function (inventory, production, QC, logistics) that communicate in real time.
2. **Role-Based Access** – Users see only the tools relevant to their role, ensuring security and ease of use.
3. **Real-Time Data** – All transactions are instantly reflected across dashboards, enabling instant decision-making.
4. **QR Code Integration** – Every finished reel receives a unique QR code. Scanning the code instantly displays its complete history, QC grades, and dispatch status.
4. **Scalable Cloud-Ready** – Built on a flexible platform that can expand as your business grows, with optional on-premise deployment.

## Benefits of Using Saheb Paper ERP
- **Increased Efficiency** – Reduce manual paperwork and processing time by up to 40%.
- **Cost Reduction** – Optimize inventory levels and resource usage, lowering operational expenses.
- **Improved Quality** – Real-time QC monitoring ensures consistent product standards.
- **Enhanced Visibility** – Instant dashboards give instant insight into production, inventory, and logistics.
- **Scalable Growth** – Modular design allows adding new features or locations without major re-engineering.
- **User-Friendly** – Intuitive interface with role-specific dashboards requires minimal training.

## Development Cost
The total development cost for Saheb Paper ERP is **₹45,000** (or equivalent currency). This investment covers system design, development, testing, and deployment, delivering a fully functional, production-ready solution.

## QR Code System
- **Generation** – Each reel is automatically assigned a unique QR code at the time of creation.
- **Scanning** – Users can scan the QR code with any standard QR reader (mobile app or handheld scanner) to instantly retrieve:
  - Reel specifications (size, ply, weight, GSM)
  - Production batch details (pulp formula, machine, shift)
  - Quality Control results and grade assignment
  - Dispatch and delivery status
- **Benefits** – Eliminates manual record-keeping, reduces errors, speeds up traceability, and provides instant access to critical information for operators, managers, and customers.

